const nav=[['overview','Overview','▦'],['investigations','Investigations','◇'],['documents','Documents','▤'],['suppliers','Suppliers','⌘'],['inventory','Receiving','▥'],['agents','Execution history','✳'],['reliability','Agent reliability','◈'],['organization','Organization',''],['settings','Settings','']];
const state={route:location.hash.slice(1)||'overview',runs:[],selected:null,logs:[],source:'No traces loaded',provenance:null,analysis:null,files:{},pending:false,error:'',menu:false,health:null};
const esc=v=>String(v??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const card=(body,cls='')=>`<section class="card ${cls}">${body}</section>`;
const badge=(text,kind='muted')=>`<span class="badge ${kind}">${esc(text)}</span>`;
const button=(text,action,primary=false,disabled=false)=>`<button class="button ${primary?'primary':'secondary'}" data-action="${action}" ${disabled||state.pending?'disabled':''}>${text}</button>`;
const header=(title,description,actions='')=>`<div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">OPERATIONS WORKSPACE</div><h1>${esc(title)}</h1><p>${esc(description)}</p></div><div class="head-actions">${actions}</div></div>`;
const successful=()=>state.runs.filter(r=>r.kind==='documents'&&r.status==='success');
const current=()=>successful().find(r=>r.id===state.selected)||successful()[0];
const field=(doc,key)=>doc?.[key]?.value??'Unavailable';
const empty=(message='Upload an invoice to begin. Orders and receiving records enable additional checks.')=>card(`<h2>No analysis yet</h2><p>${esc(message)}</p>${button('Upload documents','documents',true)}`);
const evidence=items=>`<details><summary>Inspect ${items.length} source references</summary>${items.map(e=>`<div class="trace-snippet"><strong>${esc(e.filename)} · ${esc(e.location)}</strong><pre>${esc(e.text)}</pre></div>`).join('')}</details>`;
const trace=row=>`<details class="trace-snippet"><summary>${esc(row.trace_id)} · ${esc(row.tool)} · ${esc(row.status)}</summary><p>Tool result: ${esc(row.message)}</p><p>Agent response: ${esc(row.agent_reply)}</p>${row.context?`<pre>${esc(row.context)}</pre>`:''}${/^https:\/\/github\.com\//.test(row.source_url||'')?`<a href="${esc(row.source_url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Original benchmark source</a>`:''}</details>`;
const metrics=()=>`<div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><span>Analyzed invoices</span><strong>${successful().length}</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Recorded findings</span><strong>${successful().reduce((n,r)=>n+r.findings.length,0)}</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Reliability analyses</span><strong>${state.runs.filter(r=>r.kind==='reliability'&&r.status==='success').length}</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Failed runs</span><strong>${state.runs.filter(r=>r.status==='error').length}</strong></div></div>`;
function runList(runs){return runs.length?`<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Source / run</th><th>Result</th><th>Review</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>${runs.map(r=>`<tr><td class="date-cell">${esc(new Date(r.created).toLocaleDateString(undefined,{month:'short',day:'numeric'}))}<small>${esc(new Date(r.created).toLocaleTimeString(undefined,{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}))}</small></td><td class="source-cell" title="${esc(r.invoice_reference||r.source_label||r.kind)}"><strong>${esc(r.invoice_reference||r.source_label||r.kind)}</strong><small>${r.kind==='documents'?'Document analysis':'Agent reliability'}</small></td><td>${badge(r.status==='success'?'Completed':'Failed',r.status==='success'?'success':'warning')}</td><td>${esc(({pending:'Pending review',reviewed:'Reviewed',needs_clarification:'Needs clarification'})[r.decision]||'—')}</td><td class="run-action">${r.status==='success'?`<button class="button secondary" data-run="${esc(r.id)}">Open</button>`:esc(r.error)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`:card('<p>No runs recorded. Your workspace starts empty.</p>')}
const overview=()=>`${header('Workspace overview','A clear view of your reviews and operational activity.',button('Upload documents','documents',true))}${metrics()}<div class="overview-split">${card(`<div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">WORK QUEUE</span><h2>Needs your review</h2></div>${badge(successful().filter(r=>r.decision==='pending').length+' pending')}</div>${successful().filter(r=>r.decision==='pending').slice(0,3).map(r=>`<button class="review-row" data-run="${r.id}"><span class="file-mark">${glyph('documents')}</span><span><strong>${esc(r.invoice_reference)}</strong><small>${esc(r.supplier)}</small></span><span class="review-value">${esc(r.invoice_total??'—')} ${esc(r.currency)}<small>View investigation ↗</small></span></button>`).join('')||'<div class="empty-state">You’re all caught up.<small>New investigations will appear here.</small></div>'}`)}${card(`<span class="eyebrow">RELIABILITY</span><h2>Every finding has a source.</h2><p>Review recurring agent failures alongside the conversations and tool results that support them.</p>${button('Open agent reliability →','reliability')}<div class="connection-line"><span class="status-dot ${state.health?.nim_configured?'connected':''}"></span>${state.health?.nim_configured?'NVIDIA connection configured':'NVIDIA connection not configured'}</div>`,'feature-panel')}</div>${card('<div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">ACTIVITY</span><h2>Recent analyses</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="#agents">View all activity ↗</a></div>'+runList(state.runs.slice(0,6)),'activity-panel')}`;
function investigations(){const c=current();if(!c)return header('Investigations','Results appear after an actual NVIDIA analysis.')+empty();return `${header(c.invoice_reference,`${c.model} · ${new Date(c.created).toLocaleString()}`,button('Export report','export')+button('New investigation','documents'))}<div class="case-banner"><div><h2>${esc(c.supplier)}</h2><p>${esc(c.invoice_reference)}</p></div><div class="banner-right"><strong>${esc(c.invoice_total??'Unavailable')} ${esc(c.currency)}</strong>${badge(c.decision||'pending','warning')}</div></div>${card(`<h2>${c.findings.length} differences found</h2>${c.findings.map(f=>`<div class="finding"><div><strong>${esc(f.title)}</strong><p>${esc(f.detail)}</p>${evidence(f.evidence)}</div><span class="finding-amount">${esc(f.value)}</span></div>`).join('')||'<p>No differences found in the checks performed. Incomplete checks below still require review.</p>'}`)}${card(`<h2>Checks performed</h2>${c.checks.map(f=>`<div class="source-line"><span>${esc(f.title)}</span>${badge(f.status,f.status==='passed'?'success':'warning')}</div>`).join('')||'<p>No complete numeric checks were possible.</p>'}<h3>Coverage and missing evidence</h3><ul>${c.limitations.map(x=>`<li>${esc(x)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`)}${card(`<h2>Extracted fields and original text</h2>${Object.entries(c.sources).map(([kind,source])=>`<details><summary>${esc(kind)} — ${esc(source.filename)}</summary><pre>${esc(JSON.stringify(c.fields[kind],null,2))}</pre><p>Read using ${esc(source.ingestion||'Embedded text')}</p>${source.ocr_pages?.length?`<details><summary>OCR geometry and detection scores</summary><pre>${esc(JSON.stringify(source.ocr_pages,null,2))}</pre></details>`:''}<h3>Original extracted text</h3><pre>${esc(Object.entries(source.lines).map(([loc,line])=>`${loc} ${line}`).join('\n'))}</pre></details>`).join('')}`)}${card(`<h2>Human review</h2><p>${esc(c.recommendation)}</p><p>Record a review status. No payment or email is triggered.</p><div class="head-actions">${button('Mark reviewed','reviewed')}${button('Request clarification','needs_clarification')}${button('Prepare clarification text','draft')}</div>${c.decisions?.length?`<p>${c.decisions.length} review decision(s) recorded by the local operator.</p>`:''}`)}<div id="draft-output"></div>${card('<h2>Saved investigations</h2>'+runList(successful()))}`}
const documents=()=>`${header('Source documents','Upload actual records. Invoice required; order and receiving record optional.')}${card(`<div class="live-upload"><h2>Analyze with NVIDIA</h2><p>Document text and scanned pages are sent to NVIDIA when you click Analyze. Results and extracted text are saved locally on this computer.</p>${[['invoice','Invoice (required)'],['purchase_order','Purchase order'],['receiving_record','Receiving record']].map(([kind,label])=>`<label>${label}<input type="file" data-document="${kind}" accept=".pdf,.png,.jpg,.jpeg,.txt,.csv" ${state.pending?'disabled':''}><small>${esc(state.files[kind]?.name||'No file selected')}</small></label>`).join('')}<p>PDF, PNG, JPG, TXT or CSV. Scanned pages use NVIDIA GPU OCR; up to five scanned pages per request. Matching order references and unique SKUs are required for cross-document comparisons.</p>${button(state.pending?'Analyzing…':'Analyze uploaded documents','analyze-docs',true,!state.files.invoice)}${button('Clear selection','clear-files')}</div>`)}${card('<h2>Previously analyzed records</h2>'+runList(successful()))}`;
const suppliers=()=>`${header('Suppliers','Supplier values extracted from your analyzed invoices.')}${successful().length?successful().map(c=>card(`<h2>${esc(c.supplier)}</h2><p>${esc(c.invoice_reference)} · ${esc(c.invoice_total??'Unavailable')} ${esc(c.currency)}</p><p>${c.findings.length} findings · ${esc(c.decision)}</p><button class="button secondary" data-run="${c.id}">Inspect investigation</button>`)).join(''):empty()}`;
const inventory=()=>{const c=current();return header('Receiving','Evidence from the selected investigation. No inventory balance is inferred.')+(c?card(`<h2>${esc(c.invoice_reference)}</h2>${c.fields.receiving_record?`<pre>${esc(JSON.stringify(c.fields.receiving_record.items,null,2))}</pre>`:'<p>No receiving record was provided.</p>'}${c.checks.filter(x=>x.title.includes('received')).map(x=>`<p>${esc(x.title)}: ${esc(x.detail)}</p>${evidence(x.evidence)}`).join('')}${button('Inspect investigation','investigations')}`):empty())};
const agents=()=>`${header('Execution history','Recorded server requests, including failed analyses. No animated or simulated agent stages.',button('Refresh','refresh'))}${card('<p>Documents use NVIDIA extraction followed by deterministic numeric checks. Reliability uses NVIDIA grouping and server-side evidence validation. These are backend pipelines, not five autonomous agents.</p>')}${runList(state.runs)}`;
function reliability(){const x=state.analysis;return `${header('Find recurring agent failures','Import recorded conversations and tool results, or load actual VARELQ execution metadata.',button('Import JSON / JSONL','import-logs')+button('Load VARELQ traces','own-traces')+button('Load public benchmark','public-traces'))}<input type="file" id="log-input" accept=".json,.jsonl" hidden>${card(`<h2>${esc(state.source)}</h2><p>${state.logs.length} traces loaded. ${x?'Showing the saved analysis below.':'Ready for analysis when you are.'}</p>${state.provenance?`<p>${esc(state.provenance.description)}</p><p>License: ${esc(state.provenance.license)} · <a href="${esc(state.provenance.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pinned original source</a></p>`:''}<p>Trace contents are sent to NVIDIA for analysis. Priority = severity weight (Critical 3, High 2, Medium 1) × distinct affected runs.</p>${button(state.pending?'Analyzing…':'Analyze traces with NVIDIA','analyze-logs',true,!state.logs.length)}`)}${x?`${card(`<h2>${x.issues.length} candidate recurring failure groups</h2>${x.quality_note?`<p class="api-error">${esc(x.quality_note)}</p>`:''}<p>Model hypotheses: inspect the original evidence before relying on a finding. Valid trace IDs alone do not establish that an explanation is correct.</p><p>${x.trace_count} traces analyzed with ${esc(x.model)}. ${x.rejected_groups||0} groups excluded because evidence or recurrence validation failed. Zero groups does not certify that the traces are error-free.</p>`)}${x.issues.map(issue=>card(`<div class="section-title"><h2>${esc(issue.title)}</h2>${badge(issue.severity,'warning')}</div><p>${issue.run_count} independent runs · Priority ${issue.priority_score}</p><p>${esc(issue.explanation)}</p>${issue.evidence.map(trace).join('')}<h3>Suggested fix — not executed</h3><p>${esc(issue.fix)}</p>`)).join('')}`:''}${card(`<h2>Original input evidence</h2>${state.logs.map(trace).join('')||'<p>No traces loaded.</p>'}`)}${card('<h2>Saved reliability runs</h2>'+runList(state.runs.filter(r=>r.kind==='reliability')))}`}
const defaults={name:'My organization',industry:'',region:'',operator:'Local operator',email:'',theme:'light',density:'comfortable',motion:'system'};
let preferences;try{preferences={...defaults,...JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('varelq.preferences')||'{}')}}catch{preferences={...defaults}}
const paths={overview:'M3 3h7v7H3z M14 3h7v7h-7z M3 14h7v7H3z M14 14h7v7h-7z',investigations:'M10 3H5v18h14V8l-5-5h-4 M14 3v5h5 M8 13h8 M8 17h5',documents:'M8 3h8l4 4v14H8z M16 3v5h4 M4 7v13',suppliers:'M4 21V7l8-4 8 4v14 M9 21v-6h6v6 M8 8h1 M15 8h1 M8 11h1 M15 11h1',inventory:'M3 7l9-4 9 4v10l-9 4-9-4z M3 7l9 4 9-4 M12 11v10',agents:'M3 12h4l3-8 4 16 3-8h4',reliability:'M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6z M8 12l3 3 5-6',organization:'M3 21V9h7v12 M10 21V3h11v18 M6 12h1 M6 16h1 M14 7h3 M14 11h3 M14 15h3',settings:'M12 8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8 M4 7l3-3 3 2h4l3-2 3 3-2 3v4l2 3-3 3-3-2h-4l-3 2-3-3 2-3v-4z'};
function glyph(name){return `<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="${paths[name]||paths.documents}"/></svg>`}
const initials=()=>preferences.name.trim().split(/\s+/).slice(0,2).map(x=>x[0]).join('').toUpperCase()||'V';
const option=(value,label,current)=>`<option value="${value}" ${current===value?'selected':''}>${label}</option>`;
const organization=()=>`${header('Organization','The identity behind your local workspace.')}<div class="settings-layout"><aside class="settings-nav"><a href="#organization" class="selected">Organization profile</a><a href="#settings">Personal preferences</a></aside><div><form id="organization-form" class="card settings-card"><div class="section-title"><div><h2>Organization profile</h2><p>Used in navigation and workspace identification.</p></div><span class="org-avatar large">${esc(initials())}</span></div><div class="form-grid"><label>Organization name<input name="name" required maxlength="80" value="${esc(preferences.name)}" autocomplete="organization"></label><label>Industry<input name="industry" maxlength="80" value="${esc(preferences.industry)}" placeholder="e.g. Manufacturing"></label><label>Country or region<input name="region" maxlength="80" value="${esc(preferences.region)}" placeholder="e.g. Morocco" autocomplete="country-name"></label><label>Your name<input name="operator" required maxlength="80" value="${esc(preferences.operator)}" autocomplete="name"></label><label class="full-width">Contact email <span class="muted">optional</span><input name="email" type="email" maxlength="160" value="${esc(preferences.email)}" placeholder="you@company.com" autocomplete="email"></label></div><footer class="form-footer"><span>Stored in this browser.</span><button class="button primary" type="submit">Save organization</button></footer></form>${card('<h2>Workspace access</h2><div class="member-row"><span class="org-avatar">'+esc(initials())+'</span><div><strong>'+esc(preferences.operator)+'</strong><small>Local operator · this computer</small></div>'+badge('Local access')+'</div><p>This installation has one local workspace. Organization details do not create separate data stores or access controls. Shared workspaces and invitations require an authenticated deployment.</p>','settings-card')}</div></div>`;
const settings=()=>`${header('Settings','Make the workspace feel right for the way you work.')}<div class="settings-layout"><aside class="settings-nav"><a href="#settings" class="selected">Appearance & behavior</a><a href="#organization">Organization profile</a></aside><div><form id="settings-form" class="card settings-card"><h2>Appearance & behavior</h2><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Color theme</strong><p>A quiet palette for focused work.</p></div><select name="theme" aria-label="Color theme">${option('light','Light',preferences.theme)}${option('dark','Dark',preferences.theme)}${option('system','Use system setting',preferences.theme)}</select></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Display density</strong><p>Control spacing in lists and tables.</p></div><select name="density" aria-label="Display density">${option('comfortable','Comfortable',preferences.density)}${option('compact','Compact',preferences.density)}</select></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Motion</strong><p>Subtle transitions with a reduced-motion option.</p></div><select name="motion" aria-label="Motion">${option('system','Use system setting',preferences.motion)}${option('full','Subtle motion',preferences.motion)}${option('reduced','Reduce motion',preferences.motion)}</select></div><footer class="form-footer"><span>Preferences apply to this browser.</span><button class="button primary" type="submit">Save preferences</button></footer></form>${card(`<div class="section-title"><div><h2>NVIDIA integration</h2><p>Connection managed by the local server.</p></div>${badge(state.health?.nim_configured?'Configured':'Not configured',state.health?.nim_configured?'success':'warning')}</div><div class="setting-row"><span>Model</span><code>${esc(state.health?.model||'Unavailable')}</code></div><div class="setting-row"><span>Image & scan OCR</span><span>${esc(state.health?.ocr?.provider||'Unavailable')}</span></div><p>Your key is never stored in browser preferences. To replace it, restart the launcher and enter the new key at its hidden prompt.</p>${button('Check connection','refresh')}`,'settings-card')}${card('<h2>Data & privacy</h2><p>Analysis results and extracted text are stored on this computer. Selected document text, scanned pages and traces are sent to NVIDIA only when you request analysis.</p><p>Organization information and display preferences stay in this browser.</p>','settings-card')}</div></div>`;
function applyPreferences(){const dark=preferences.theme==='dark'||preferences.theme==='system'&&matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;document.documentElement.dataset.theme=dark?'dark':'light';document.documentElement.dataset.density=preferences.density;document.documentElement.dataset.motion=preferences.motion==='reduced'||preferences.motion==='system'&&matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches?'reduced':'full'}
let renderedRoute='';
function render(){applyPreferences();const changed=renderedRoute!==state.route;renderedRoute=state.route;const navLink=([id,label])=>`<a href="#${id}" class="nav-link ${state.route===id?'active':''}" ${state.route===id?'aria-current="page"':''}>${glyph(id)}<span>${label}</span></a>`;document.getElementById('app').innerHTML=`<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><div class="app-shell"><aside class="sidebar" aria-label="Workspace navigation"><a class="brand" href="#overview"><span class="brand-mark">v</span><span>varelq<span class="brand-period">.</span></span></a><a href="#organization" class="workspace"><span class="org-avatar">${esc(initials())}</span><span><strong>${esc(preferences.name)}</strong><small>Local workspace</small></span><span class="workspace-chevron">⌄</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><div class="nav-label">WORKSPACE</div>${nav.slice(0,2).map(navLink).join('')}<div class="nav-label">RECORDS</div>${nav.slice(2,5).map(navLink).join('')}<div class="nav-label">INTELLIGENCE</div>${[nav[6],nav[5]].map(navLink).join('')}</nav><div class="sidebar-bottom">${nav.slice(7).map(navLink).join('')}<div class="operator"><span class="operator-avatar">${esc((preferences.operator||'L')[0].toUpperCase())}</span><span><strong>${esc(preferences.operator)}</strong><small>Local operator</small></span><span class="status-dot connected"></span></div></div></aside>${state.menu?'<button class="mobile-overlay" data-action="menu" aria-label="Close navigation"></button>':''}<div class="main-shell"><header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb"><button class="mobile-menu" data-action="menu" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="${state.menu}">☰</button><span>${esc(preferences.name)}</span><span class="breadcrumb-divider">/</span><strong>${esc(nav.find(n=>n[0]===state.route)?.[1]||'Overview')}</strong></div><a class="connection-status" href="#settings"><span class="status-dot ${state.health?.nim_configured?'connected':''}"></span>${state.health?(state.health.nim_configured?'NVIDIA configured':'Setup required'):'Connecting…'}</a></header><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="${changed?'page-enter':''}">${state.error?`<div class="api-error" role="alert">${esc(state.error)}</div>`:''}${state.notice?`<div class="notice" role="status">${esc(state.notice)}</div>`:''}${state.pending?'<div class="pending-banner" role="status"><span class="loading-indicator"></span>Processing your request<span>Waiting for NVIDIA</span></div>':''}${({overview,investigations,documents,suppliers,inventory,agents,reliability,organization,settings}[state.route]||overview)()}</main><footer class="workspace-footer"><span>VARELQ · Operations workspace</span><span>Evidence before decisions.</span></footer></div></div>`;document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open',state.menu)}
document.addEventListener('submit',e=>{if(!['organization-form','settings-form'].includes(e.target.id))return;e.preventDefault();const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target));if(data.name!==undefined&&!data.name.trim()){e.target.elements.name.setCustomValidity('Enter an organization name.');e.target.elements.name.reportValidity();return}const updated={...preferences,...Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(data).map(([k,v])=>[k,v.trim()]))};try{localStorage.setItem('varelq.preferences',JSON.stringify(updated));preferences=updated;state.notice=e.target.id==='organization-form'?'Organization details saved.':'Preferences saved.';state.error='';render()}catch{state.error='Your browser could not save preferences. Check browser storage permissions.';render()}});
for(const query of ['(prefers-color-scheme: dark)','(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)'])matchMedia(query).addEventListener('change',applyPreferences);
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'&&state.menu){state.menu=false;render()}});
async function request(url,options){const r=await fetch(url,options);let data;try{data=await r.json()}catch{throw Error('Server unavailable or outdated. Restart Launch-Live.cmd.')}if(!r.ok)throw Error(data.error||`HTTP ${r.status}`);return data}
async function refresh(){const [health,runs]=await Promise.all([request('/api/health'),request('/api/runs')]);state.health=health;state.runs=runs.runs}
function go(route){state.route=route;state.menu=false;state.notice='';location.hash=route;render()}
async function perform(work){if(state.pending)return;state.pending=true;state.error='';render();try{await work()}catch(e){state.error=e.message}finally{state.pending=false;try{await refresh()}catch(e){state.error=state.error||e.message}render()}}
const post=(url,data)=>request(url,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(data)});
function validateLogs(rows){if(!Array.isArray(rows)||!rows.length||rows.length>500)throw Error('Import 1–500 traces.');const ids=new Set();for(const [i,row] of rows.entries()){if(!row||!['trace_id','tool','status','message','agent_reply'].every(k=>typeof row[k]==='string')||!row.trace_id.trim())throw Error(`Trace ${i+1} requires nonempty trace_id and string tool, status, message, agent_reply fields.`);if(ids.has(row.trace_id))throw Error('Duplicate trace IDs are not accepted.');ids.add(row.trace_id)}if(JSON.stringify(rows).length>240000)throw Error('Import a smaller batch (maximum 240,000 characters). Nothing is truncated.');return rows}
function setLogs(logs,label,provenance=null){state.logs=validateLogs(logs);state.source=label;state.provenance=provenance;state.analysis=null}
document.addEventListener('change',async e=>{if(e.target.dataset.document){state.files[e.target.dataset.document]=e.target.files[0];render()}if(e.target.id==='log-input'){const file=e.target.files[0];if(!file)return;try{if(file.size>2e6)throw Error('File exceeds 2 MB.');const text=await file.text();const data=file.name.endsWith('.jsonl')?text.trim().split(/\r?\n/).filter(Boolean).map(line=>JSON.parse(line)):JSON.parse(text);setLogs(Array.isArray(data)?data:data.logs,file.name);state.error=''}catch(err){state.error=err.message}render()}});
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const runId=e.target.closest('[data-run]')?.dataset.run;if(runId){const r=state.runs.find(x=>x.id===runId);if(r.kind==='documents'){state.selected=r.id;go('investigations')}else{state.analysis=r;state.logs=r.logs;state.source=r.source_label||'Saved analysis';state.provenance=null;go('reliability')}return}const action=e.target.closest('[data-action]')?.dataset.action;if(!action)return;if(action==='menu'){state.menu=!state.menu;render();return}if(nav.some(n=>n[0]===action)){go(action);return}if(action==='import-logs'){document.getElementById('log-input').click();return}if(action==='clear-files'){state.files={};render();return}if(action==='export'){const c=current();const a=document.createElement('a');const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(c,null,2)],{type:'application/json'}));a.href=url;a.download=`varelq-${c.id}.json`;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);return}if(action==='draft'){const c=current();document.getElementById('draft-output').innerHTML=card(`<h2>Clarification draft</h2><textarea aria-label="Clarification draft" rows="10">${esc(`Subject: Clarification requested — ${c.invoice_reference}\n\nPlease review these findings against the original records:\n\n${c.findings.map(f=>`${f.title}: ${f.detail}`).join('\n')}\n\nIncomplete checks:\n${c.limitations.join('\n')}\n\nPlease provide clarification or supporting documents.`)}</textarea><p>Editable draft only. Not sent.</p>`);return}perform(async()=>{if(action==='refresh')await refresh();if(action==='public-traces'){const x=await request('/api/public-traces');setLogs(x.logs,`${x.provenance.name} · ${x.logs.length} of ${x.available_runs} runs`,x.provenance)}if(action==='own-traces'){const x=await request('/api/traces');if(!x.logs.length)throw Error('No VARELQ runs recorded yet. Analyze documents first.');setLogs(x.logs,'Recorded VARELQ execution metadata')}if(action==='analyze-logs'){state.analysis=null;state.analysis=await post('/api/agent-failures',{logs:state.logs,source_label:state.source})}if(action==='analyze-docs'){if(!state.files.invoice)throw Error('Select an invoice.');const form=new FormData();Object.entries(state.files).forEach(([k,v])=>{if(v)form.append(k,v)});const result=await request('/api/documents/analyze',{method:'POST',body:form});state.selected=result.id;state.files={};go('investigations')}if(['reviewed','needs_clarification'].includes(action))await post('/api/decision',{id:current().id,decision:action})})});
document.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(event.target.closest('.skip-link')){event.preventDefault();document.getElementById('main-content').focus()}});
window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>{state.route=location.hash.slice(1)||'overview';state.menu=false;state.notice='';render()});
render();refresh().then(render).catch(e=>{state.error=e.message;render()});
